---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy';
const description = 'Privacy policy for FreezerBatchCocktails.com';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>

      <div class="editorial">
        <p><em>Last updated: May 2026</em></p>

        <p>
          FreezerBatchCocktails.com ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This page
          explains what we collect, why, and how to opt out. Plain English — no
          legalese where we can avoid it.
        </p>

        <h2>Who this site is for</h2>
        <p>
          This site is intended for readers who are at least 21 years old (or the
          legal drinking age in your country). We do not knowingly collect
          information from anyone under 21. If you are under 21, please leave the
          site.
        </p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>

        <h3>Email addresses</h3>
        <p>
          If you submit your email — either through the inline "Email me this
          recipe" form on a calculator, or through the newsletter signup at the
          bottom of the page — we send the address to our email automation
          provider (n8n + downstream mail services) so we can send you the recipe
          and, optionally, future recipe updates.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, or trade your email. Every message we send
          includes a one-click unsubscribe link.
        </p>

        <h3>Usage analytics</h3>
        <p>
          We use privacy-respecting analytics to count visits and understand
          which pages and recipes are popular. Analytics data is aggregated and
          does not identify you personally.
        </p>

        <h3>Cookies and similar technologies</h3>
        <p>
          The site itself does not set tracking cookies. Your browser may store
          small amounts of data locally (for example, your last-used recipe or
          unit preference); that data stays on your device.
        </p>
        <p>
          However, this site is supported in part by advertising. Third-party
          vendors, including <strong>Google</strong>, may use cookies to serve
          ads based on your prior visits to this site or other sites.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to
            serve ads based on your visits to this site and/or other sites on
            the internet.
          </li>
          <li>
            You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
            <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Ads Settings</a>.
            You can also opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for
            personalized advertising by visiting
            <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            For visitors in the EU, UK, or California: where required, you'll
            see a consent prompt before any non-essential cookies are set, and
            you can withdraw consent at any time.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
        <p>
          Some links on this site are affiliate links to Amazon and other
          retailers. When you click an affiliate link, the destination site may
          set its own cookies and collect information per its own privacy
          policy. We are an Amazon Associate; as such, we earn from qualifying
          purchases. Those commissions help keep the calculator free.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party services we use</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — hosting, DNS, basic security and aggregate analytics.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> — typography. May log IP addresses per Google's standard practice.</li>
          <li><strong>n8n / email provider</strong> — sending recipe emails and the newsletter, only when you submit your address.</li>
          <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> (where applicable) — display advertising.</li>
          <li><strong>Amazon Associates</strong> — affiliate links to bar tools and books.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can request a copy of any personal data we hold about you, or ask
          us to delete it, by emailing
          <a href="mailto:hello@freezerbatchcocktails.com">hello@freezerbatchcocktails.com</a>.
          We typically respond within a few business days.
        </p>
        <p>
          Residents of the EU, UK, and California have additional rights under
          GDPR / UK-GDPR / CCPA respectively. Contact us with any such request
          and we'll honor it.
        </p>

        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>
          This site is not directed at children. We do not knowingly collect
          information from anyone under 18. If you believe a child has provided
          us with personal information, please contact us and we'll delete it.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. We'll bump the "Last
          updated" date at the top whenever we do. Material changes will be
          announced on the home page or to email subscribers.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy? Email
          <a href="mailto:hello@freezerbatchcocktails.com">hello@freezerbatchcocktails.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
